    <briefdescription>
<para>The top level structure representing a minidump object, consisting of a minidump header, and zero or more streams. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>To construct an <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_minidump_y_a_m_l_1_1_object" kindref="compound">Object</ref> from a minidump file, use the static create function. To serialize to/from yaml, use the appropriate streaming operator on a yaml stream. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
